                <h2 class="anton text-5xl text-center text-black max-md:max-w-full max-md:text-4xl">
                    Frazzled Cafe in Southend
                </h2>
                <div
                    class="self-stretch mt-12 text-2xl font-medium leading-7 text-center text-black max-md:mt-10 max-md:mr-2.5 max-md:max-w-full">
                    <p class="p2 text-center">
                        Frazzled Cafe is excited to announce an expansion of our successful face to face meetings for
                        people in the Southend-on-Sea area.
                        Led by our amazing Volunteer Team, we are now running sessions every Monday, where local
                        residents can share, listen and be supported in a confidential space.</p>
                    <br>
                    <p class="p2 text-center">Similar to our online sessions, these face to face meetings are a
                        non-judgemental and confidential space where people who are feeling frazzled have the chance to
                        be heard. Speaking is optional, and silences can often be welcome.</p>
                    <br>
                    <p class="p2 text-center">Meetings take place every Monday at:
                        <strong>Attic Cafe, 48 Eastern Esplanade, Southend-on-Sea SS1 2ES</strong>
                    </p>
                    <br>
                    <p class="p2 text-center">
                        Join us for a coffee at 6:45 arrival for a cup of tea / coffee, 7pm start.
                    </p>
