                        Free parking is available on Victoria Road, Shaftesbury Avenue, and Eastern Esplanade past the
                        Premier Inn.
                    </p>
                    <br>
                    <p class="p2 text-center">
                        If you're travelling into Southend on the train the nearest C2C line station is Southend East
                        and the nearest Great Western line is Southend Victoria.
                    </p>
                    <br>
                    <p class="p2 text-center">
                        Walking into a new place for the first time can be tricky, so one of our friendly Frazzled Cafe
                        team will be there to welcome you and help you feel comfortable.
                    </p>
                    <br>
                    <p class="p2 text-center">
                        As there are limited spaces per meeting, please sign up via the booking page to attend, and
                        cancel your place either using the booking instructions or by emailing
                        <strong><a href="mailto:team@frazzledcafe.org">team@frazzledcafe.org</a></strong> if you can no
                        longer come so that someone on the waiting list can take your space.
                    </p>
                    <br>
                    <p class="p2 text-center">
                        For any questions please email <strong><a
                                href="mailto:team@frazzledcafe.org">team@frazzledcafe.org</a></strong>
                    </p>
